ed to take effect the next day with visa rules.", "s": 8.683, "e": 22.208}, {"text": "When a reporter asked when the new rules started, a flustered Schabowski answered, \"As far as I know, immediately, without delay.\"", "s": 22.328, "e": 31.434}, {"text": "Thousands of Berliners rushed the checkpoints that night, forcing overwhelmed guards to open the gates.", "s": 31.554, "e": 38.197}]}